 The baker’s expression is intense, yet comically serious, as if he's about to take on the world with nothing but his dough and determination.\n\nThe title \"Breaking Bread\" is displayed in bold, stylized text at the top, with the \"Breaking\" in a gritty, cracked font, while \"Bread\" is written in warm, golden letters resembling freshly baked loaves. The tagline beneath reads, \"Baking is a Dangerous Game,\" adding to the pun-filled humor.\n\nThe overall color scheme of the poster is a mix of warm, bakery hues with the gritty, dark tones reminiscent of the original show, blending the intense drama of Breaking Bad with the lighthearted, culinary twist of \"Breaking Bread.\"", [false, true]], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 107, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [433.8982849121094, 542.6494750976562], "pos": [580, 880], "id": 1, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 68}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [79], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#474769", "widgets_values": ["flux1-dev-Q8_0.gguf"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "UnetLoaderGGUF", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#333355", "size": [315, 58], "pos": [-690, 1070], "id": 105, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "UnetLoaderGGUF"}, "order": 27}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [78], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["flux1-dev-fp8.safetensors", "fp8_e4m3fn_fast"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [315, 82], "pos": [-690, 900], "id": 9, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 28}, {"outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [3