  （示例：`包心菜，菜市场`）\n\n2. 点击右上角 🚀「执行」开始生成图片  \n   \n\n---\n\n## 视频工作区\n将静态图片转换为动态视频（拨开外层显示外星生物）\n\n1. 首先激活 🔘「开启视频生成」开关\n\n2. 图像传输操作流程：\n   - 在图像工作区生成的图片上 **右键点击** → 选择 `Copy Image`\n   - 点击视频工作区的「加载图片」节点\n   - 使用快捷键 `Ctrl+V`（Windows）或 `Cmd+V`（Mac）粘贴\n\n3. 点击右上角 🚀「执行」生成视频\n\n---\n\n## 注意事项 ⚠️\n1. 当「开启视频生成」激活时：\n   - 图像工作区将 **自动跳过图片生成**\n   - 需要重新生成图片时，请先关闭该开关\n\n2. 图片名称 将会保存到“output/食物中的异形”文件夹里面\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用前先看！！！！！！！！！！！", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#ac2a37", "size": [490, 660], "pos": [1330, -520], "id": 162, "properties": {}, "order": 38}, {"outputs": [{"name": "vram_management_args", "links": [], "label": "vram_management_args", "type": "VRAM_MANAGEMENTARGS", "localized_name": "vram_management_args"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": [1], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "WanVideoVRAMManagement", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [315, 58], "pos": [4160.919921875, 1245.756591796875], "id": 88, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper", "ver": "389bbd343c7cfd306b59a4ae49f2a0fa4f754357", "Node name for S&R": "WanVideoVRAMManagement"}, "order": 39}, {"outputs": [{"name": "block_swap_args", "slot_index": 0, "links": [77], "label": "block_swap_args", "type": "BLOCKSWAPARGS", "localized_name": "block_swap_args"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": [20, false, false, true], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "WanVideoBlockSwap", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [315, 130], "pos": [4159.080078125, 1059.3175048828125], "id": 86, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper", "ver": "389bbd343c7cfd306b59a4ae49f2a0fa4f754357", "Node name for S&R": "WanVideoBlockSwap"}, "order": 40}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "torch_compile_args", "links": [76], "label": "torch_compile_args", "type": "WANCOMPILEARGS", "localized_name": "torch_compile_args"}], "size": [390.5999755859375, 178], "pos": [4084.599609375, 810.2373657226562], "widgets_values": ["inductor", false, "default", false, 64,